# Lychee ignore list for the DeepSeek monorepo
# Patterns: URLs containing these are skipped entirely (never checked, never
# reported). Keep this list minimal - only what is genuinely unverifiable.

# shields.io badges are dynamic images and fail randomly under load; the
# badge URLs carry no stable status to verify
https://img.shields.io/

# Social/donation endpoints that block link checkers outright
https://twitter.com/
https://x.com/
https://www.paypal.com/
https://www.patreon.com/
https://tidelift.com/

# Placeholder/example domains (never real targets)
example.com
localhost
